{"title": "Githborn Psionic Weapon", "pageid": 17540, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Githborn_Psionic_Weapon", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See <a href=\"/wiki/Githborn_Psionic_Weapon_(1d6)\" title=\"Githborn Psionic Weapon (1d6)\">Githborn Psionic Weapon (1d6)</a> for the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Sword_of_the_Astral_Plane\" title=\"Silver Sword of the Astral Plane\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Sword_of_the_Astral_Plane\" title=\"Silver Sword of the Astral Plane\">Silver Sword of the Astral Plane</a> version.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Githborn Psionic Weapon</b> is a passive feature granted by certain Githyanki weapons when wielded by a <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When wielded by a <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a> this weapon deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Greatsword_(Psionic)\" title=\"Githyanki Greatsword (Psionic)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Greatsword_(Psionic)\" title=\"Githyanki Greatsword (Psionic)\">Githyanki Greatsword</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Longsword_(Psionic)\" title=\"Githyanki Longsword (Psionic)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Githyanki_Longsword_Psionic_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Longsword_Psionic_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Githyanki_Longsword_Psionic_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Githyanki_Longsword_Psionic_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Githyanki_Longsword_Psionic_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Githyanki_Longsword_Psionic_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Githyanki_Longsword_Psionic_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Longsword_Psionic_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Githyanki_Longsword_Psionic_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Longsword_(Psionic)\" title=\"Githyanki Longsword (Psionic)\">Githyanki Longsword (Psionic)</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soulbreaker_Greatsword\" title=\"Soulbreaker Greatsword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Githyanki_Greatsword_Red_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Soulbreaker_Greatsword\" title=\"Soulbreaker Greatsword\">Soulbreaker Greatsword</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Baretha\" title=\"Baretha\">Baretha</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\">Har'rak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Therezzyn\" title=\"Therezzyn\">Therezzyn</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a>-exclusive bonuses from Githborn Psionic Weapon can also be enabled by being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/30px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/40px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"disguised\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">disguised</a> as one. However, the wielder must be disguised before equipping the weapon for this to work.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202129\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2492/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26540/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7274/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 250/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937300/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.144      1 -total\n 76.85%   49.297      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 44.10%   28.288      4 Template:Item_icon\n 36.50%   23.410      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 29.02%   18.616      3 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 26.82%   17.205      3 Template:MdRarityItem\n 23.09%   14.811      1 Template:Hatnote\n 22.40%   14.369      1 Template:RarityItem\n 17.16%   11.010     10 Template:Ifempty\n 12.36%    7.930     33 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:17540-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202129 and revision id 371463. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}